{"id":3160,"slug":"3160-async-vs-sync-endpoints-trong-fastapi-khi-nao-dung-def-hay-async-def","category":"Python","subcategory":"FastAPI","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Async vs sync endpoints trong FastAPI — khi nào dùng def hay async def?","question_en":"Async vs sync endpoints in FastAPI — when to use def vs async def?","answer_vi":"FastAPI chạy trên Starlette (ASGI), hỗ trợ cả sync và async endpoints:\n\n**async def**: dùng khi endpoint thực hiện I/O async (database queries async, HTTP calls async):\n```python\n@app.get(\"/users/{id}\")\nasync def get_user(id: int, db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)):\n    user = await db.get(User, id)  # Async I/O\n    return user\n```\n\n**def (sync)**: khi dùng blocking operations không thể async. FastAPI tự động chạy sync endpoint trong ThreadPoolExecutor để không block event loop:\n```python\n@app.get(\"/compute\")\ndef cpu_task(data: list):\n    return [x**2 for x in data]  # CPU-bound — sync OK\n```\n\n**Không được làm**: gọi blocking I/O trong async def — block toàn bộ event loop:\n```python\n@app.get(\"/wrong\")\nasync def bad_endpoint():\n    time.sleep(1)           # BLOCKING! Sai!\n    requests.get(\"...\")     # BLOCKING! Sai!\n    # Dùng asyncio.sleep() và httpx.AsyncClient() thay\n```\n\n**Rule**: I/O async → `async def`. CPU-bound hoặc blocking library → `def`. Không bao giờ dùng blocking I/O trong `async def`.","answer_en":"FastAPI runs on Starlette (ASGI) and supports both sync and async endpoints:\n\n**async def**: use it when the endpoint performs async I/O (async database queries, async HTTP calls):\n```python\n@app.get(\"/users/{id}\")\nasync def get_user(id: int, db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)):\n    user = await db.get(User, id)  # async I/O\n    return user\n```\n\n**def (sync)**: use it for blocking operations that cannot be made async. FastAPI runs sync endpoints in a ThreadPoolExecutor so they do not block the event loop:\n```python\n@app.get(\"/compute\")\ndef cpu_task(data: list):\n    return [x**2 for x in data]  # CPU-bound — sync is fine\n```\n\n**Never do this**: blocking I/O inside an `async def` blocks the entire event loop:\n```python\n@app.get(\"/wrong\")\nasync def bad_endpoint():\n    time.sleep(1)           # BLOCKING! Wrong!\n    requests.get(\"...\")     # BLOCKING! Wrong!\n    # use asyncio.sleep() and httpx.AsyncClient() instead\n```\n\n**Rule**: async I/O → `async def`. CPU-bound or a blocking library → `def`. Never put blocking I/O inside `async def`","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">FastAPI chạy trên Starlette (ASGI), hỗ trợ cả sync và async endpoints:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>async def</strong>: dùng khi endpoint thực hiện I/O async (database queries async, HTTP calls async):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@app.get(&quot;/users/{id}&quot;)\nasync def get_user(id: int, db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)):\n    user = await db.get(User, id)  # Async I/O\n    return user\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.get(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/users/{id}&quot;</span></span>)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get_user</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">int</span>, db: AsyncSession = Depends(<span class=\"hljs-params\">get_db</span>)</span>):\n    user = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> db.get(User, <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Async I/O</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> user</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>def (sync)</strong>: khi dùng blocking operations không thể async.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">FastAPI tự động chạy sync endpoint trong ThreadPoolExecutor để không block event loop:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@app.get(&quot;/compute&quot;)\ndef cpu_task(data: list):\n    return [x**2 for x in data]  # CPU-bound — sync OK\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.get(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/compute&quot;</span></span>)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cpu_task</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">data: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">list</span></span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> [x**<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> x <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> data]  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># CPU-bound — sync OK</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Không được làm</strong>: gọi blocking I/O trong async def — block toàn bộ event loop:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@app.get(&quot;/wrong&quot;)\nasync def bad_endpoint():\n    time.sleep(1)           # BLOCKING! Sai!\n    requests.get(&quot;...&quot;)     # BLOCKING! Sai!\n    # Dùng asyncio.sleep() và httpx.AsyncClient() thay\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.get(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/wrong&quot;</span></span>)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">bad_endpoint</span>():\n    time.sleep(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)           <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># BLOCKING! Sai!</span>\n    requests.get(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># BLOCKING! Sai!</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Dùng asyncio.sleep() và httpx.AsyncClient() thay</span></code></pre></div><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><strong>Rule</strong>: I/O async → <code>async def</code>.</li><li>CPU-bound hoặc blocking library → <code>def</code>.</li><li>Không bao giờ dùng blocking I/O trong <code>async def</code>.</li></ul>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">FastAPI runs on Starlette (ASGI) and supports both sync and async endpoints:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>async def</strong>: use it when the endpoint performs async I/O (async database queries, async HTTP calls):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@app.get(&quot;/users/{id}&quot;)\nasync def get_user(id: int, db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)):\n    user = await db.get(User, id)  # async I/O\n    return user\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.get(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/users/{id}&qu